      "html": "<p>Search \"construction software UK\" and you get platforms built for main contractors with hundreds of staff and an IT team. A 10-person electrical contractor is not that customer. This is an honest guide to <strong>construction software for small firms</strong> in the UK. It covers the inspection and H&S records layer, with no extra admin.</p>"
