      "heading": "Built for the wrong firm",
      "html": "<p>Search \"construction software UK\" and enterprise platforms fill the page: Procore, Autodesk Build, Aconex. They are built for main contractors with hundreds of staff, project teams and IT departments that can run a set-up over months.</p><p>A 10-person electrical contractor is not who they were made for. Set-up, training and moving data can take longer than a typical small job. The yearly cost can top all a small firm pays for software. This guide skips them. It covers how to manage site inspections and H&S records without more admin than the job is worth.</p>"
